    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "For example, \"1. Introduction\", should be Times 12- point boldface, initially capitalized, flush lefl, with one blank line before, and one blank line after. Use a period (\".\") after the heading mumber, not a col",
        "bbox": [
            35,
