        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "As in this heading. they should be Times 11-point boldface, initially capitalized, flush left, with one blank line before, and one afte",
        "bbox": [
            38,
            606,
            465,
            655
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "8.1.1. Third-order Headings. Third-order headings, as in this paragraph, are discouraged. However, if you must use them, use 10-point Times, boldface, initially capitalized, flush left. preceded by one blank line. followed by a period and your text on the same line.",
